      <canvas id="cumulativeChart"></canvas>
    </div>
    <p>The cumulative curve shows a steady influx of new voices: roughly 74% of all ceremonies (69 out of 93) introduced a first-time winner. The curve's slope is steepest in the first three decades, when the category was new and the pool of film composers was rapidly expanding. The contemporary era continues to add new names, though repeat winners also appear with regularity.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: Most Awarded Composers -->
