    <h2>Most Awarded Composers</h2>
    <p>Three composers share the all-time record at four wins each, spanning very different eras of Hollywood history. Behind them, a tier of three-time winners includes some of the most recognizable names in film music. In total, 14 composers have won the award more than once, meaning roughly one in five distinct winners (20.3%) is a repeat champion.</p>

